  "description" : "Parking transactions for street parking and city operated lots. This includes data from physical parking kiosks and app payments through ParkATX.\n\nNote: Due to an integration issue with a vendor, <b>no parking app (ParkATX) transactions have been added to this dataset since October 2025</b>. Physical kiosk transactions are still being added daily.\n\nSpatial data of physical parking assets such as pay stations, meters, and parking zones are available on <a href = \"https://austin.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=6a5424475a384ee8af39b67d8f86dfca\" target=\"_blank\">ArcGIS Online</a> (Requires a COA ArcGIS Online account).\n\nThe source code that processes the city's parking transaction data is available on our <a href = \"https://github.com/cityofaustin/atd-parking-data\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub repository</a>.\n\n<a aria-label=\"View the City of Austin Open Data Terms of Use in a new window\" href=\"https://data.austintexas.gov/stories/s/ranj-cccq\" target=\"_blank\">City of Austin Open Data Terms of Use</a>",
